      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Coragem. Makuhita fica mais forte ao suportar treinamentos rigorosos. É um Pokémon corajoso, capaz de resistir a qualquer ataque. Ele endurece o corpo golpeando repetidamente árvores grossas, desenvolvendo uma constituição robusta e um espírito destemido.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Humanoide &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 75% M / 25% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Makuhita pode evoluir para Hariyama no nível 8 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Focus Energy, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Sand Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Arm Thrust</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Fake Out</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Force Palm</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Whirlwind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Knock Off</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Bulk Up, Vital Throw</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Belly Drum</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Detect, Smelling Salts</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Seismic Toss</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Focus Punch, Wake-Up Slap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Endure</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Close Combat</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Heavy Slam, Reversal</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Body Press, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulk Up, Bulldoze, Chilling Water, Close Combat, Coaching, Confide, Dig, Double Team, Double-Edge, Drain Punch, Earthquake, Endure, Facade, Fire Punch, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Heavy Slam, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Ice Punch, Knock Off, Low Kick, Low Sweep, Metronome, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Poison Jab, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Reversal, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Role Play, Round, Sleep Talk, Smack Down, Snore, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Sunny Day, Superpower, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Thief, Thunder Punch, Toxic, Upper Hand, Vacuum Wave, Work Up, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Bullet Punch, Chip Away, Counter, Cross Chop, Detect, Dynamic Punch, Feint, Feint Attack, Focus Punch, Foresight, Helping Hand, Revenge, Wake-Up Slap, Wide Guard</p>",
